{"id":"cpp-memoryManagement","cat":"cpp","title":"C++ 内存模型与常见陷阱","file":"cpp/memoryManagement.md","authors":["csview-local 示例"],"type":"qa","questions":[{"id":"cpp-memoryManagement~1","n":1,"title":"new/delete 和 malloc/free 的区别？","doc":"cpp-memoryManagement","cat":"cpp","badges":[{"kind":"master","text":"掌握"}],"leetcode":null,"words":316,"html":"<ul>\n<li><code>new</code> 是<strong>运算符</strong>：先分配内存，再调用构造函数；<code>delete</code> 先析构再释放。<code>malloc</code> 只是库函数，只管字节，不认识对象。</li>\n<li><code>new</code> 失败抛 <code>std::bad_alloc</code>，<code>malloc</code> 失败返回 <code>nullptr</code>。</li>\n<li><code>new</code> 返回具体类型指针，<code>malloc</code> 返回 <code>void*</code> 需要转换。</li>\n<li><code>new[]</code> 必须配 <code>delete[]</code>：数组会在头部额外记录元素个数，用错释放方式会导致只析构第一个元素或破坏堆结构。</li>\n<li>二者<strong>不能混用</strong>：<code>malloc</code> 出来的用 <code>delete</code> 释放是未定义行为。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>现代 C++ 里业务代码基本不该直接出现 <code>new</code>，用 <code>make_unique</code> / <code>make_shared</code> 让所有权在类型上就表达清楚。</p>\n","toc":[],"freq":0},{"id":"cpp-memoryManagement~2","n":2,"title":"内存泄漏之外，还有哪些内存错误？","doc":"cpp-memoryManagement","cat":"cpp","badges":[{"kind":"key","text":"重要"}],"leetcode":null,"words":319,"html":"<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>定位手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>悬垂指针 / use-after-free</td>\n<td>释放后继续访问，可能读到脏数据或崩溃</td>\n<td>ASan</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>越界读写</td>\n<td>破坏相邻对象或堆元数据，崩溃点离现场很远</td>\n<td>ASan / valgrind</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复释放</td>\n<td>堆结构损坏，<code>double free or corruption</code></td>\n<td>ASan</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未初始化读取</td>\n<td>值随机，Debug 与 Release 行为不一致</td>\n<td>MSan / valgrind</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存泄漏</td>\n<td>RSS 持续上涨，长跑后 OOM</td>\n<td>LSan / heaptrack</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><div class=\"adm adm-warning\"><div class=\"adm-head\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10.3 3.9 2.6 17.2A2 2 0 0 0 4.3 20h15.4a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-2.8L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0Z\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4M12 16.6v.4\"/></svg><span>崩溃点往往不是案发现场</span></div><div class=\"adm-body\"><p>越界写会先破坏别的对象，等到那个对象被使用时才崩溃，堆栈完全指向无辜代码。所以看到「随机崩溃」优先上 AddressSanitizer，而不是逐行读代码。</p>\n</div></div>","toc":[],"freq":0},{"id":"cpp-memoryManagement~3","n":3,"title":"RAII 为什么是 C++ 的核心惯用法？","doc":"cpp-memoryManagement","cat":"cpp","badges":[{"kind":"master","text":"掌握"}],"leetcode":null,"words":202,"html":"<p>RAII 把<strong>资源生命周期绑定到对象生命周期</strong>：构造时获取，析构时释放。因为 C++ 保证栈对象在离开作用域时（包括抛异常栈展开时）一定析构，所以释放动作不可能被漏掉。</p>\n<p>这解决了 <code>try/catch</code> 或提前 <code>return</code> 分支里忘记释放的经典问题：</p>\n<figure class=\"codeblock\" data-lang=\"cpp\"><figcaption class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"cb-lang\">C++</span><span class=\"cb-meta\">3 行</span><button class=\"cb-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy aria-label=\"复制代码\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8\"/></svg><span>复制</span></button></figcaption><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light night-owl\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">std</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">lock_guard</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">std</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">mutex</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">> </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">lk</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">mu</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">);</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">   // 构造加锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">if</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">!</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">ready) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">return</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">                   // 提前返回，析构自动解锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">process</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">();</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">                            // 抛异常也自动解锁</span></span></code></pre></figure><p>锁、文件句柄、socket、事务、临时目录切换，全都适合包成 RAII 类型。判断标准很简单：<strong>任何「必须成对出现的操作」都应该交给一个对象来保证配对</strong>。</p>\n","toc":[],"freq":0},{"id":"cpp-memoryManagement~4","n":4,"title":"一个对象的内存布局是怎样的？","doc":"cpp-memoryManagement","cat":"cpp","badges":[{"kind":"know","text":"了解"}],"leetcode":null,"words":212,"html":"<p>以含虚函数的类为例，典型布局是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>vptr</strong>（8 字节，指向 vtable），位于对象起始处。</li>\n<li>基类子对象的成员。</li>\n<li>派生类自己的成员，按<strong>声明顺序</strong>排列，并按各自对齐要求插入填充。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>由此推出：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>sizeof</code> 包含填充字节，把小成员集中声明能减少 padding。</li>\n<li>多重继承会有多个 vptr；虚继承还会引入虚基类偏移，布局更复杂。</li>\n<li>空类 <code>sizeof</code> 为 1，保证不同对象有不同地址；作为基类时可被优化为 0（空基类优化）。</li>\n</ul>\n","toc":[],"freq":0}],"words":1049,"intro":""}